(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-18","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["南渠的[[moslem|穆斯林]]面包师给我们指路，店里挂着一幅[[cosmic|宇宙的]]星空画，遮[[against|着]]裂墙。[[government|政府]]修路通知占了另一面。我买些[[dessert|点心]]，他才[[resume|继续]]说供水车常来，请我别替他垫钱，基金还会[[reimburse|偿付]]送水费。他把[[jug|水壶]]放在门边，妻子在后房打[[nap|盹]]；窗下的[[cosmos|大波斯菊]]缺水垂头。援助在这里不是一句口号，车不来时，人得自己走到坡下抬水。他给我们看收据，最早一张的日期正是印厂改版后的次日。","我听说有人把来问水的人骂作[[brute|野蛮人]]，因此更加想保持[[impartial|不偏袒的]]态度。收据签收人连续三天[[absent|缺席]]，居民准备自己[[rebuild|重建]]储水池，墙上慈善[[sale|义卖]]告示却说工程早已完成。面包师不愿[[kill|扼杀]]孩子的希望，扶着女儿的[[neck|脖子]]让她看地图。每个签收日期都是一个[[datum|数据点]]，我请程雾[[consider|考虑]]车辆到场记录；有两天因桥封路，所谓准点送达根本[[impossible|不可能]]。可那些天居民确实领过水，这意味着地点或时间还有别的记录。","一个态度[[aggressive|强硬的]]联络员说居民[[committee|委员会]]已经表示[[satisfaction|满意]]，领水点在河边[[landing|码头]]，不必[[notice|注意]]旧泵。老陈问坡度为何与图纸差十[[degree|度]]，他指责我们偏[[favor|袒护]]别的承包商。程雾说没人能用一张盖章纸把疑问[[imprison|关住]]，她只问[[specific|具体的]]日期，[[namely|也就是]]桥封闭那两天。联络员终于拿出手写调度条，上面写着改从果园供水。我们没有夺下纸，只请他把条子贴到地图旁，让两件东西一起进入照片。","这张条子仍不能[[satisfy|使我确信]]水经过检验。夜里有人报告[[leakage|漏水]]，光学员借[[optics|光学]]镜头找到湿坡。我学过的[[demography|人口统计学]]只告诉我受影响人数，不能[[inversely|反过来]]证明每人都病了。作这种推断会[[improper|不合适]]。居民的[[mood|心情]]很复杂：希望储备[[plentiful|充足]]，又怕一查便停水。程雾要[[shoot|拍摄]]泵口，先给何警官发定位；老陈在两侧标同一[[level|高度]]，发现水从[[orchard|果园]]下面流出来。那里不是图纸上的河水管，而是旧厂方向的沟渠。","关于来源的[[derivation|推论]]尚待核查，联络员却急着喊[[okay|可以]]，说看见水就够了。老陈说裸泵的防护[[inadequate|不足]]，必须请懂设备的人来。他一向[[cautious|小心]]，这次仍先[[halt|停下]]，让我们退回硬地。附近[[shopkeeper|店主]]拿出一块[[limestone|石灰石]]，说工队拿它做过标点。我把[[overcoat|大衣]]挂在护栏，挡住孩子钻入的缺口。监测牌上二氧化碳[[dioxide|二氧化物]]的词只剩一半，真正的检验报告一页也没有；小女孩却认真问我，下周还能不能做面包。","我们没有替她保证，也没让居民今夜无水。何警官联系供水部门调来独立车辆，联络员协助登记，没有再挡路。程雾记录了大家的要求：查清旧泵、保留送水、公布实际到场时间。我把手写条和收据送进防水袋，第一次看清箱子的移动怎样落到日常生活里。面包师说果园管理员守过旧港器材库，或许知道泵上为什么没有滤筒。天黑前我们向果园走，老陈步子很慢，那边地面软，他不愿让第二个人为寻找一件证据摔下去。"],"en":["A [[moslem|Moslem]] baker directed us through South Channel. A [[cosmic|cosmic]] picture hung [[against|against]] a cracked wall opposite a [[government|government]] road notice. After I bought [[dessert|dessert]], he would [[resume|resume]] explaining water deliveries. The fund would [[reimburse|reimburse]] his transport costs. His [[jug|jug]] stood by the door; his wife took a [[nap|nap]] behind it, while [[cosmos|cosmos]] flowers drooped outside. Aid mattered here. Without a truck people carried water uphill. His earliest receipt followed the printer's revision by one day.","Questioners had been called a [[brute|brute]], so I sought an [[impartial|impartial]] approach. A receiver was [[absent|absent]] for three days. Residents would [[rebuild|rebuild]] a tank, though a charity [[sale|sale]] poster claimed completion. Refusing to [[kill|kill]] his daughter's hope, the baker supported her [[neck|neck]] while showing the map. Each date was a [[datum|datum]]. I asked Cheng to [[consider|consider]] arrivals. With the bridge closed, two claimed punctual deliveries were [[impossible|impossible]]. Residents had received water nonetheless; another place or time must explain it.","An [[aggressive|aggressive]] liaison claimed the residents' [[committee|committee]] had expressed [[satisfaction|satisfaction]]. Collection was at the [[landing|landing]]; we need not [[notice|notice]] the pump. Chen asked why its slope differed by ten [[degree|degrees]]. Accused of showing [[favor|favor]] to another contractor, Cheng said a stamped page could not [[imprison|imprison]] questions. She requested [[specific|specific]] dates, [[namely|namely]] those bridge closures. The liaison produced a handwritten instruction redirecting deliveries from the orchard. We photographed it beside the map rather than seize it.","The note could not [[satisfy|satisfy]] me about testing. Reports of [[leakage|leakage]] led an [[optics|optics]] technician to a wet slope. [[demography|Demography]] could count affected people, not [[inversely|inversely]] establish illness in every resident. That would be [[improper|improper]]. Their [[mood|mood]] mixed hope for [[plentiful|plentiful]] water with fear of losing it. Before starting to [[shoot|shoot]] the outlet, Cheng sent He its location. Chen marked equal [[level|level]] points. Water emerged beneath the [[orchard|orchard]], from a ditch facing the old factory rather than the mapped river pipe.","Our [[derivation|derivation]] still required checks. The liaison declared it [[okay|okay]] because water existed. Chen found protection [[inadequate|inadequate]]. Being [[cautious|cautious]], he called a [[halt|halt]] and moved us to firm ground. A [[shopkeeper|shopkeeper]] produced [[limestone|limestone]] used by the builders as a marker. I hung my [[overcoat|overcoat]] across a gap accessible to children. A carbon [[dioxide|dioxide]] monitoring label survived only in part. No test report remained. The baker's daughter asked whether they could still bake next week.","We promised nothing we could not establish. He arranged independent supply vehicles through the water department. The liaison helped registration. Cheng recorded residents' requests: investigate the pump, retain deliveries, disclose real arrival times. Bagging notes and receipts, I understood how freight entered daily life. The baker said the orchard custodian had guarded old port equipment and might explain the missing filter. We went before dark. Chen moved carefully over soft ground, unwilling to let another person fall for the sake of evidence."]});
